            <section class="pawqeris-overview py-5">
                <div class="container">

                    <div class="row justify-content-center text-center">
                        <div class="col-lg-8">

                            <h2 class="pawqeris-overview-title mb-3">
                                Overview
                            </h2>

                            <p class="pawqeris-overview-text">
                                Novaryx is an AI agent that finishes the job. Users can ask it to research a topic,
                                order dinner, buy a product, book a trip, manage a calendar, or summarise the morning's
                                news, and it carries the task through from start to end.
                            </p>

                            <p class="pawqeris-overview-text">
                                An assistant that spends money and handles personal details has to be trustworthy. So
                                every user receives a blockchain-based identity that defines what the agent can do, how
                                much it can spend, and leaves a permanent, verifiable record of each action.
                            </p>

                            <p class="pawqeris-overview-text mb-4">
                                Clarisco Solutions delivered the project from concept to launch, covering strategy, UX,
                                AI engineering, blockchain architecture, integrations, and testing.
                            </p>

                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="row justify-content-center">
                        <div class="col-lg-7 col-md-9 col-11 text-center">
