                                    </p>

                                    <div class="pawqeris-solution-highlight text-center">
                                        "People will only hand real tasks to an agent they can trust. With Novaryx,
                                        every
                                        action stays inside the user's limits and leaves a record anyone can verify."
                                    </div>

                                </div>

                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

